   "text": "The prover recomputes the root from its leaf and the sibling\nhashes (grey) inside the proof. The chain only checks that\nthe result is a valid root: checkRoot(root). The leaf stays hidden.",
   "originalText": "The prover recomputes the root from its leaf and the sibling\nhashes (grey) inside the proof. The chain only checks that\nthe result is a valid root: checkRoot(root). The leaf stays hidden.",
