   "text": "Shamir over GF(2⁸), per byte:   f(x) = K + a₁x + … + a_{k−1}x^{k−1},   a_j random\nshare i = (i, f(i))   for i = 1 … n         any k shares rebuild K, k−1 reveal nothing",
