   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Seal to the new phone (per share):\neph ← X25519 keypair       Z = ECDH(eph, pk_dev)\nk_s = HKDF-SHA256(Z, salt = eph || pk_dev, info = \"keeproxy:share\")\nsealed = eph || AES-GCM(k_s, share, AAD = pk_dev)   →   releaseShare",
   "originalText": "Seal to the new phone (per share):\neph ← X25519 keypair       Z = ECDH(eph, pk_dev)\nk_s = HKDF-SHA256(Z, salt = eph || pk_dev, info = \"keeproxy:share\")\nsealed = eph || AES-GCM(k_s, share, AAD = pk_dev)   →   releaseShare",
