   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "On the phone:\nopen k seals with the device key → (x_i, y_i)\nK = Σ_i y_i · Π_{j≠i} x_j / (x_j − x_i)        (Lagrange at x = 0, in GF(2⁸))\nrefuse unless SHA-256(blob) = d and version = n, then decrypt",
   "originalText": "On the phone:\nopen k seals with the device key → (x_i, y_i)\nK = Σ_i y_i · Π_{j≠i} x_j / (x_j − x_i)        (Lagrange at x = 0, in GF(2⁸))\nrefuse unless SHA-256(blob) = d and version = n, then decrypt",
